{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 11, :comments ["<b>And his brothers envied him.</b> For they thought that because of his excellence in his father's eyes his heart was exalted to tell these dreams, as though with his father's approval." "<b>And his father kept the matter.</b> For he thought that the dream would prove true, and he longed and waited for it to be fulfilled — as they said, of blessed memory (Sanhedrin 105a): everyone is jealous except his son and his disciple."], :book :genesis, :voice :sforno, :lang :en, :chapter 37, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [{"versionTitle" "Sefaria community Hebrew (PD)", "language" "he"}], :timestamp "2026-07-22T16:33:34.730739602Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}